### =====================================================
### WorkflowExecution/save - Casos de prueba (WD-1582)
### Crea o actualiza una ejecución de workflow (upsert por workflowExecutionId)
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Crear una ejecución de workflow nueva (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowTypeId": 1,
  "workflowStatusId": 1,
  "externalWorkflowId": "wf-external-12345",
  "externalRunId": "run-external-67890",
  "inputJson": "{\"routeId\": 123, \"unitId\": 456}",
  "startTime": "2026-08-21T14:30:00",
  "routeAssignmentId": 1,
  "useSignals": true
}

### Test 2: Actualizar una ejecución existente a completada con resultado — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowExecutionId": 1,
  "workflowStatusId": 2,
  "resultJson": "{\"success\": true, \"assignmentId\": 789}",
  "endTime": "2026-08-21T14:35:00"
}

### Test 3: Marcar una ejecución existente como fallida con mensaje de error — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowExecutionId": 1,
  "workflowStatusId": 3,
  "errorMessage": "Failed to process route assignment",
  "endTime": "2026-08-21T14:40:00"
}

### Test 4: Ejecución hija con parentWorkflowExecutionId — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowTypeId": 1,
  "workflowStatusId": 1,
  "externalWorkflowId": "wf-external-child-001",
  "externalRunId": "run-external-child-001",
  "startTime": "2026-08-21T15:00:00",
  "parentWorkflowExecutionId": 1,
  "useSignals": false
}

### Test 5: Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowTypeId": 1,
  "workflowStatusId": 1,
  "externalWorkflowId": "wf-external-12345",
  "externalRunId": "run-external-67890"
}

### Test 6: Body con tipo inválido (workflowTypeId como texto) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowTypeId": "no-es-numero",
  "workflowStatusId": 1
}

### Test 7: Body vacío, el SP no puede guardar sin datos mínimos → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test 8: Actualizar una ejecución inexistente → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/WorkflowExecution/save
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workflowExecutionId": 999999999,
  "workflowStatusId": 2,
  "endTime": "2026-08-21T14:35:00"
}
